      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first hotel opened in 1885, sparking a wave of commerce that soon saw stores, a newspaper called the Potter Review, and a church.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
